# What `gcloud builds submit` / `gcloud run deploy --source` uploads to Google Cloud.
# Only the backend image is built (see Dockerfile: it copies requirements-backend.txt and backend/), so keep everything else -
# above all any .env with real keys - out of the upload.
#!include:.gitignore

.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
frontend/
tests/
supabase/
jupyter notebooks/
.pytest_cache/
deploy/
*.md
